						"reviews",
						"5f5884d8697cf121f83d898f"
					]
				},
				"description": "\"images\" key should be an array with paths to reviews files. Images are optional and are overridden by each request. If you want to add a new image you should send all the paths again in order to be saved.\n\n\"upvotes\" & \"downvotes\" keys support both 1 / -1 values in order to increment/decrement correctly.\n\"communityCustomerId\" is the ID of the current user that is doing an upvote/downvote.\n\n\"rating\" maximum allowed number for rating is 5.\n\n\"terms\" key is a boolean for Terms and conditions.\n\n\"typeId\" & \"type\" is the ID and the type of the review."
			},
